      "source": "Default implementation of <a href=\"ToolExecutionExceptionProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.tool.execution\"><code>ToolExecutionExceptionProcessor</code></a>. Can be configured\nwith an allowlist of exceptions that will be unwrapped from the\n<a href=\"ToolExecutionException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.tool.execution\"><code>ToolExecutionException</code></a> and rethrown as is.",
